Rom 5:1 , Being justified by faith, we have peace with God;
Rom 5:2 , and joy in our hope;
Rom 5:8 , that since we were reconciled by his blood, when we were enemies;
Rom 5:10 , we shall much more be saved, being reconciled;
Rom 5:12 , As sin and death came by Adam;
Rom 5:17 , so much more righteousness and life by Jesus Christ;
Rom 5:20 , Where sin abounded, grace did superabound.
